/* ================================================================
 * Code ranges
 *   Z0001-Z0FFF   semantic analysis (historical, keep as-is)
 *   Z1xxx         lexical analysis      (src/zlex.c)
 *   Z2xxx         syntax analysis       (src/zparse.c)
 *   Z3xxx         semantic analysis     (src/zsem.c)
 *   Z4xxx         code generation       (src/codegen/)
 *   Z5xxx         macros and annotations
 *   Z9xxx         internal compiler errors
 * ================================================================ */

